# 统一换行与文本判定：仓库内一律以 LF 存储，避免 Windows/macOS 协作出 CRLF 抖动
* text=auto eol=lf

# 明确文本类型的扩展名（防止二进制误判）
*.md   text
*.json text
*.yml  text
*.yaml text
*.mjs  text
*.cjs  text
*.js   text
*.ps1  text
*.sh   text
*.txt  text

# 记住本项目以中文文档为主，GitHub 语言统计按代码走
*.md   linguist-documentation
data/** linguist-documentation
docs/** linguist-documentation
preset/**/SKILL.md linguist-documentation

# 二进制
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.pdf  binary

# 发布产物不参与 diff 统计
package-lock.json -diff linguist-generated
